  "_doc": "Shared loot tables. Weapon filters match the catalog (w30/w40): exotic, slots (KINETIC/ENERGY/POWER), ammo (PRIMARY/SPECIAL/HEAVY), families, ids, exclude, rarity (W325: common/uncommon/rare = Red War skins, legendary, exotic; omitted = catalog legendary+exotic). Engram tiers decode through engramTables. A fresh weapon fills trait columns by tier: common 0, uncommon 1, rare and above all. Reduced pre-auto-dismantle pacing: minor 3%, major 10%, boss one 50% roll; standard strike completion retains one guaranteed weapon and its chest has one 50% bonus roll. Exodus Crash compensates its longer mandatory walking route with two guaranteed completion weapons and 80-120 chest Glimmer, versus the standard 40-60. This fixed completion bonus does not scale with elapsed time or distance. Tier weights and engram decoding remain unchanged. Minecraft-specific economy tuning, not source-game drop rates.",
